  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Your objective is to protect the system from incoming cyber threats. Enemies
    will move through the network path and try to reach the end of the system. To
    stop them, you must choose defensive towers from the defenses menu and place
    them around the map.\r\n\r\nFirst, select the tower you want using Left Click
    in the defenses menu. Then, move your character to the green spaces where you
    want to place the tower and press\n\"E\" to place. \r\n\r\nControls:\nWASD -
    Move around the map.\r\nLeft Click - Select towers from the defenses menu.\r\nE
    - Place the selected tower at your current position."
